,"status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p134","chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m134-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"知伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000274","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p134","chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m134-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"知伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000274","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p134","chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m135-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"知伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000274","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p135","chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji033-104","person_id":"cbr-p000274","surfaces":["智伯"],"scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-004-zhou","c-shiji-033-lu"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p064","quote":"定王十六年，三晉滅智伯，分有其地。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p091","quote":"十三年，三晉滅智伯，分其地有之。"}],"rationale":"按文公以後立嗣、昭公出奔、夾谷會盟、徵百牢與魯君世系的具體事件及國別暫定異稱，後期同爵稱不與先君混同。身份、匿名指代與數位疑讀待覆核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"d-shiji034-031","person_id":"cbr-p000274","surfaces":["知伯"],"scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-004-zhou","c-shiji-034-yan"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p064","quote":"定王十六年，三晉滅智伯，分有其地。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-034-yan:p015","quote":"孝公十二年，韓、魏、趙滅知伯，分其地，三晉彊。"}],"rationale":"依周初封建、燕君世系、割地救燕、讓國及秦滅諸國的具體語境暫定異稱。繼位不自動證父子；同爵者分國別與前後世代。太子平／燕昭王依本篇明示，不表示年代及世系已校定。作君奭為書名，君奭不説之君奭才暫解召公稱呼。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"d-shiji039-039","person_id":"cbr-p000274","surfaces":["知伯"],"scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-004-zhou","c-shiji-039-jin"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p064","quote":"定王十六年，三晉滅智伯，分有其地。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p133","quote":"出公十七年，知伯與趙、韓、魏共分范、中行地以爲邑。出公怒，告齊、魯，欲以伐四卿。四卿恐，遂反攻出公。出公奔齊，道死。故知伯乃立昭公曾孫驕爲晉君，是爲哀公。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p134","quote":"哀公大父雍，晉昭公少子也，號爲戴子。戴子生忌。忌善知伯，蚤死，故知伯欲盡并晉，未敢，乃立忌子驕爲君。當是時，晉國政皆決知伯，晉哀公不得有所制。知伯遂有范、中行地，最彊。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p135","quote":"哀公四年，趙襄子、韓康子、魏桓子共殺知伯，盡并其地。"}],"rationale":"按本篇明示名與稱號、晉世系與具體事件暫定所列提及同指；附各段原文，未按同字短名全域合併；紀年與版本差異待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p064","text":"定王十六年，三晉滅智伯，分有其地。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m064-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"定王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000273","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m064-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"智伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000274","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","book_id":"b-shiji-004","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-004-zhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p047","text":"厲共公二年，蜀人來賂。十六年，塹河旁。以兵二萬伐大荔，取其王城。二十一年，初縣頻陽。晉取武成。二十四年，晉亂，殺智伯，分其國與趙、韓、魏。二十五年，智開與邑人來奔。三十三年，伐義渠，虜其王。三十四年，日食。厲共公卒，子躁公立。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m047-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"厲共公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000436","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m047-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"其王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未定指代、群體或官稱；商君語為篇章指引，不當作獨立個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m047-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"智伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000274","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m047-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"智開","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000437","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m047-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"其王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未定指代、群體或官稱；商君語為篇章指引，不當作獨立個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m047-0103","start":103,"end":106,"surface":"厲共公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000436","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m047-0109","start":109,"end":111,"surface":"躁公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000438","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","book_id":"b-shiji-005","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p011","text":"大索，逐客，李斯上書說，乃止逐客令。李斯因說秦王，請先取韓以恐他國，於是使斯下韓。韓王患之。與韓非謀弱秦。大梁人尉繚來，說秦王曰：「以秦之彊，諸侯譬如郡縣之君，臣但恐諸侯合從，翕而出不意，此乃智伯、夫差、湣王之所以亡也。願大王毋愛財物，賂其豪臣，以亂其謀，不過亡三十萬金，則諸侯可盡。」秦王從其計，見尉繚亢禮，衣服食飲與繚同。繚曰：「秦王為人，蜂準，長目，摯鳥膺，豺聲，少恩而虎狼心，居約易出人下，得志亦輕食人。我布衣，然見我常身自下我。誠使秦王得志於天下，天下皆為虜矣。不可與久游。」乃亡去。秦王覺，固止，以為秦國尉，卒用其計策。而李斯用事。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m011-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"李斯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000537","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m011-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"李斯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000537","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m011-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"秦王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官稱或句讀疑問待核；不補造姓名或直接同稱合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m011-0037","start":37,"end":38,"surface":"斯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000537","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m011-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"韓王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官稱或句讀疑問待核；不補造姓名或直接同稱合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m011-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"韓非","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000554","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m011-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"尉繚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000555","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m011-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surfa