jin:m133-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"知伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000274","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m133-0009","start":9,"end":14,"surface":"趙、韓、魏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m133-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"出公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001824","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m133-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"四卿","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m133-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"四卿","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m133-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"出公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001824","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m133-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"出公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001824","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m133-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"知伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000274","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m133-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001209","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m133-0067","start":67,"end":68,"surface":"驕","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001825","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m133-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"哀公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001825","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p134","text":"哀公大父雍，晉昭公少子也，號爲戴子。戴子生忌。忌善知伯，蚤死，故知伯欲盡并晉，未敢，乃立忌子驕爲君。當是時，晉國政皆決知伯，晉哀公不得有所制。知伯遂有范、中行地，最彊。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m134-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"哀公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001825","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m134-0004","start":4,"end":5,"surface":"雍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001826","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m134-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001209","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m134-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"戴子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001826","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m134-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"戴子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001826","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m134-0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001827","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m134-0023","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001827","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m134-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"知伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000274","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m134-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"知伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000274","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m134-0044","start":44,"end":45,"surface":"忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001827","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m134-0046","start":46,"end":47,"surface":"驕","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001825","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m134-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"知伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000274","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m134-0062","start":62,"end":65,"surface":"晉哀公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001825","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m134-0065","start":65,"end":70,"surface":"不得有所制","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m134-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"知伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000274","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p135","text":"哀公四年，趙襄子、韓康子、魏桓子共殺知伯，盡并其地。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m135-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"哀公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001825","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m135-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"趙襄子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001828","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m135-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"韓康子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001829","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m135-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"魏桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001830","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m135-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"知伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000274","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-004","source_id":"s-shiji-004-zhou","source":{"title":"史記／卷004","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷004","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷004&oldid=7909147","revision_id":7909147,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"正文全文；排除註釋版導覽、現代節標題與註號；行內校勘標記另存。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫 CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"editorial_readings":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p017","witness_form":"［左］","body_reading":"","note":"數位見證行內校勘標記另存；有兩讀時正文保存改讀前的字，不